  "document": "Edithvale railway station\nEdithvale railway station is located on the Frankston line in Victoria, Australia. It serves the south-eastern Melbourne suburb of Edithvale opening on 20 September 1919. In 1981 the station buildings were rebuilt. In its early years, a siding existed on the down side before Platform 2."
